description:
We are recruiting for Talent Acquisition Trainee










 Join NES at an exciting time!










 About US










 As part of the NES Fircroft Group, NES Advantage is the provider of workforce solutions to the global engineering sectors, including Renewables, Alternative Energy, Life Sciences, Chemicals, Oil \& Gas, Power Generation, Infrastructure and Mining sectors worldwide. We offer outsourced solutions in the areas of: Recruitment Process Outsourcing (RPO) and Contingent Workforce Outsourcing (CWO/MSP)We provide workforce strategy, solutions, and operations with specialist industry expertise across the global engineering industries and scientific segments.










**Job Roles and Responsibilities:** 









* Search and Selection – contacting candidates regarding availability and suitability for current vacancies;
* Active on social media. Creative and is open to making posts and video material on social media channels on behalf of the company.
* Formatting CVs;
* Interviewing candidates and preparing interview notes;
* Submission of suitable candidates CVs and interview notes to clients within defined timeframe;
* Arranging interviews upon request from clients;
* Preparing candidates for interviews;
* Obtaining feedback on candidates from client;
* Being a key contact in negotiation between clients and successful candidates on Job Offer;
* Proactive marketing of existing hot candidates;
* Logging Jobs onto the websites;
* Awareness of new business potential;
* Adding and updating candidates on Bullhorn
* Writing Job Advertisements;
* Developing and maintaining relationships with current clients and contractors;
* Updating Interview and Vacancy database
* Preparing monthly reporting to Fircroft
* Company branding.
